   "message": "1 headline(s) wrap past two lines at 1080px: \"1 默念三秒我的下班我做主。 2 直接站起来收拾包。不解释不道歉。 3 出门别回头，轻快会追上你\" → 3 lines (6 words, 28px)",
   "fix": "Cut words first (a headline is a title, not a sentence). Then give it a wider measure. Lower the size only as a last resort and never below the scale you chose. A real statement paragraph belongs in a <p> or <blockquote> at 32px or less."
